ietf.phext — every IETF standard in one phext: 10,052 records (9,863 issued RFCs + 189 not-issued, annotated), 9,856 full texts, 96,168 reference edges, 6,888 implementation links across 88 projects; 564,589,207 bytes, sha256 9ecd7946…. Published into wbic16/rfcbox@exo as a 5-part xz stream with a setup.sh that reassembles and hash-verifies; served over SQ (tenant p=ietf).

